contact (k nearest cells, weight exp(-d / median d)), paracrine (Gaussian, \code{sigma_p}) and niche (Gaussian,
\code{sigma_n}); paracrine and niche are evaluated on grids. The score is high when receptor-expressing B cells
sit among ligand-expressing A cells.
